[
  {"id": 0, "src_sha256": "71a6f7c3641258df270c73a40e8fe2687348d04c112aaa02944eb8728bd75aee", "zh": "冒險？哎呀，我很樂意幫忙。聽起來非常有趣。 "},
  {"id": 1, "src_sha256": "7446ded9404809b0f0d8e52eb2efe29eb1713539b0eea6c2d0c94b8341ae67e3", "zh": "真是愉快。 "},
  {"id": 2, "src_sha256": "3c02b98c7f00a189df7da9946863ddc0ff6943d631c65288d078d9a6733a0d83", "zh": "恐怕我受傷了。 "},
  {"id": 3, "src_sha256": "44ec904281af27d9197aaeb42c17ffd190dfac5969a94de24820fb507a64ca02", "zh": "這個傷很嚴重。 "},
  {"id": 4, "src_sha256": "1446ff95d12b801a3c1833fa7773b07010711a6281e0ee74f36da0c339a27477", "zh": "我想是時候休息了。 "},
  {"id": 5, "src_sha256": "5d5de0989ed486352eddb5fe92cd090af1f1cf9dc69b10f0bba96bbf66dd3361", "zh": "我覺得相當奇怪。 "},
  {"id": 6, "src_sha256": "03df5d16e2ab4abada9bc7942892711bdad2a8c9fba09abee38c7c1b63b24a62", "zh": "我……身體不適。 "},
  {"id": 7, "src_sha256": "004c0da75c6ba22edb96b78cd4db50c54b754d883c6e4a7a61b2f401bfccf9ae", "zh": "奇怪。我看不見了！ "},
  {"id": 8, "src_sha256": "5ba6be903c5af9b836841cf133aa0524881d4dc28979627d7f5403480bf228cc", "zh": "真是的。我看起來像是搬運用的牲口嗎？ "},
  {"id": 9, "src_sha256": "de453afa9feb31134558c01769b3e5055703ed00c7c8fdf090866efbef82f33f", "zh": "天哪。我好像麻痺了。 "},
  {"id": 10, "src_sha256": "a365634233b15def19e97189483526d2b45f176e5c5199d5e6c66b9e1371e60d", "zh": "說得一點也沒錯。 "},
  {"id": 11, "src_sha256": "52eee038323e98697742300ddb30edb09ce6574d99a540e2ed416900e1743f14", "zh": "嗯，我可不想再經歷一次。 "},
  {"id": 12, "src_sha256": "94c59ac9216c7211a85bbdcbed7c856186aeb23a939595ac83d82a189d1cb693", "zh": "我回來了。我錯過了什麼嗎？ "},
  {"id": 13, "src_sha256": "95cc456998202a63dc571d2b5bc74d05459b394be7caf70eafabc7ab681e7e32", "zh": "那真是不幸。我們有什麼能做的嗎？ "},
  {"id": 14, "src_sha256": "2034e3ecae598349d737f533a1473e50c995bbb92584822e47459c0a37fab37f", "zh": "你們不覺得這地方迷人極了嗎？ "},
  {"id": 15, "src_sha256": "d577c720405a26252c49fc6ea3fc3b83b03db3992306931f806f9e649a2a9b1f", "zh": "旅行確實能開闊心胸。 "},
  {"id": 16, "src_sha256": "d41349e779d1f0a131cb190f9909ee75bfe261056709dc66632de75d853ff3f5", "zh": "真是抱歉。是我的錯。 "},
  {"id": 17, "src_sha256": "66e99572e61927b05b4f347702be7cfe5d56f204b9b0e6eee1fc4c923076322f", "zh": "留神你在做什麼！ "},
  {"id": 18, "src_sha256": "059397d0163a91c3efedb2cff0dcc2ff6e8c392371123c5e4528c5b15e2916f1", "zh": "真可惜。他是很好的同伴。 "},
  {"id": 19, "src_sha256": "159ebae3f6e0fbd62b28c0a523d7c18203c5e1172b32f9047c1055eb8ba1452b", "zh": "噢，不要是她！她一向那麼勇敢。 "},
  {"id": 20, "src_sha256": "afbaa991182438e7f340ae0daf2f2bb97f1a079bca2a8e553bd243bb87e67a98", "zh": "跟著我們旅行似乎對健康有害呢。 "},
  {"id": 21, "src_sha256": "fbfd579b6a87407c13ff2a0fe4adfcc359a4595b74e7ab8767ad8c97f9b56c0d", "zh": "來吧，我們可以做得比這更好。 "},
  {"id": 22, "src_sha256": "ec8bbf470f67cf9625ba134fe1073fef67aae0d7158f8687cc78eefac19ef669", "zh": "噢，該死。這場冒險的發展跟我原本的計畫不太一樣。 "},
  {"id": 23, "src_sha256": "0647966db65b5d54bfe707ff198ffe2961cb3de4a86031e4b1f9c45458d0c867", "zh": "哎，看那邊。 "},
  {"id": 24, "src_sha256": "0a6f79ac677829feac3210b92ece4022b1fbbf279cd82a55639572ee1674e0db", "zh": "我看到了什麼。 "},
  {"id": 25, "src_sha256": "32d3f1b00aae43bf7f5d1e1dd30303e9dd818d3a9d9b7e68243e71ba24fbbbf6", "zh": "我們得想個辦法處理這個陷阱。 "},
  {"id": 26, "src_sha256": "4063740b75e18e0261b6b37033fcb7842a608b1f243900ea590602e5548c0ef8", "zh": "我相信這裡藏著什麼東西。 "},
  {"id": 27, "src_sha256": "9c962fc5c42ed2e7bacb036d9ef22829cac42020190fe7b9ffdb2035a71ce7e5", "zh": "我不喜歡這裡的樣子。 "},
  {"id": 28, "src_sha256": "1d7aa7632b3694b2054b51670c864790aa3d70e3d32a20e2e9f02320a131f8c8", "zh": "我受傷了。 "},
  {"id": 29, "src_sha256": "edd67e51a76ee83a1efd00459eb979ed0d2a1c871e2c2ea6684618d1b6654431", "zh": "這會是很好的練習。 "},
  {"id": 30, "src_sha256": "58d2969695fc40c6bd23700d8e07e246d69daf42dead0cde05f4f76e876d37f0", "zh": "戰鬥？多麼刺激！ "},
  {"id": 31, "src_sha256": "2e0a5282f3dc26e56da74da169856f2a3b77ac0e35ef1d11e50d597983ebf89a", "zh": "這場遭遇戰將會極為刺激。 "},
  {"id": 32, "src_sha256": "3573db6ad3aab2e83e0d940cbde92ccbdecea440ba95360f6a828582d0e6f803", "zh": "現在該瞄準哪裡呢？ "},
  {"id": 33, "src_sha256": "4257fadf8dcd2894f0b0892514878ecc3f114d39d98735be2cbedeffa2e06ec4", "zh": "這比我預期的刺激太多了。 "},
  {"id": 34, "src_sha256": "05a0a253b2cfa1c7c6140871ec957f99ca490c30f33ec5259ae953240c274f81", "zh": "恐怕你沒打中我。 "},
  {"id": 35, "src_sha256": "767d09b7a3961fb43a59b28d58eab36605d889cee5e7a544810a8ef57b0cccb9", "zh": "真是愉快！ "},
  {"id": 36, "src_sha256": "2e338f710fb479b470d6a8b2197322a48597792cddcd35d5cf1b14105824b9c3", "zh": "嗯，他就這樣完蛋了。我真想不通他為什麼那樣濫用自己的能力。我想有些人就是從來沒人教過他們該如何守規矩。 "},
  {"id": 37, "src_sha256": "10a2c34caa3b15a47f26d13540cf189a3f936f7118032b7ffd42892da55d7003", "zh": "真是令人神清氣爽。 "},
  {"id": 38, "src_sha256": "4a26e6f2b93552dbf3fa529e62560860c0faeb16f6df0457d33fac9d441aadfe", "zh": "這下會是誰呢？ "},
  {"id": 39, "src_sha256": "a0325c268132a69b5ed8e52aa9bae6705b4f596ac0c8305e043a7736f768d767", "zh": "我想我需要重新裝填。 "},
  {"id": 40, "src_sha256": "23e59f8f8f0665c10a21da4ad43abd99acc48243fadc2dd0a199f9842ba2a1bb", "zh": "我們隊上有人不見了！ "},
  {"id": 41, "src_sha256": "ba9ff6d179f8217ff57d244ea33cfec1332905f8c057c9196ff6cff6427e7c24", "zh": "終於來到這裡，真令人愉快。不過我想 Dark Savant 是不會讓我們在這裡放鬆的。 "},
  {"id": 42, "src_sha256": "264a094434e37df281dca6ab8101dc4651665f2e35e5a258bea867bda4f72ef7", "zh": "被選來統治宇宙，我想是莫大的榮耀，但我可不認為會比我們剛才那場小小的冒險有趣一半！ "},
  {"id": 43, "src_sha256": "97131c1f00e145961235b5859d5659d142c9c13972bb0b6dd61bfcfd05450e45", "zh": "別傻了。那種事得找個男人才行。 "},
  {"id": 46, "src_sha256": "a937c62a94073a2bda1418685ccb5cc95b0ce5824ec6444de45e6bcbb694ddac", "zh": "這就是生命本身之力？那麼，我會盡量別把它摔了。 "},
  {"id": 47, "src_sha256": "c564b40d7a3eaa10582b5927a91f50de1422e812f494a771c1833f9ff5f0d9b6", "zh": "原來這就是 Destinae Dominus。他們到底是怎麼把宇宙所有的知識塞進這麼小的東西裡的？ "},
  {"id": 48, "src_sha256": "d1fceda4f5b0e7c2b1c40dedf6ebdc3b99728909544ebfd4c25581f4e5818f96", "zh": "真聰明。哎呀，我們簡直是一群飛賊呢。好了，趁 {{Mook}} 還沒發現東西不見了，我們走吧。 "},
  {"id": 49, "src_sha256": "f17de273cc5433043162b806e773694a507d8e4bd730fab03835446cbca917f3", "zh": "這個混沌裝置本身的來歷似乎也相當混亂。 "},
  {"id": 50, "src_sha256": "c317d2fcff97fdc8719ae1e841ffac6ec267b524f6bf7b9605148717a2dceb39", "zh": "我們早該想到 Savant 會找人替他幹髒活。 "},
  {"id": 51, "src_sha256": "9ea9afedd190d89bf78731b0417c2a0ad50c7d75e141e08c2d8a8e95368e814e", "zh": "請稍等。恐怕我得暫時向你們告別了。我的 {{Mook}} 朋友邀我去拜訪他們。別擔心，我很快就回來。 "},
  {"id": 52, "src_sha256": "55410c5cbd714c361b63f6f1dc51fe90df16dbfed830016aee4360fdb20c783d", "zh": "能回來真好。我有些你們可能會感興趣的消息。{{Mook}} 在裡面有一件不尋常的東西。我想那是 Chaos Moliri。 "},
  {"id": 53, "src_sha256": "68f9095aae44a7a7a9caab393295d81a516d64fa52d28f0bdf75c9b35a91e4d2", "zh": "恐怕不可能。 "},
  {"id": 54, "src_sha256": "69dc721e520f2792938883ae7fa19d44e604465471fd7a1c42df073e34d4d649", "zh": "嗯，這是我聽過最離譜的謊話。 "},
  {"id": 55, "src_sha256": "106c62aae6053124c1cd657430c4dfb982ef1e127a0f5ab2721a613421691361", "zh": "噢，多麼壯麗。 "},
  {"id": 56, "src_sha256": "08868d6b48c3e4f17dc3342780cd201b7daf33c9e90e6c7d950b8100791eb279", "zh": "嗯，剛才真有趣。 "},
  {"id": 57, "src_sha256": "27cfe045b60a78e32faca99d358792fcaeadf36d592cbc3f37018791cff3bb4b", "zh": "哎呀 Vi，見到你真高興！ "},
  {"id": 58, "src_sha256": "88b74119f6ff4dfa7ac97d3189cfaca9a88de380f4ae65f50c5bcce7065a2ca2", "zh": "好險！ "},
  {"id": 59, "src_sha256": "83334acf7e7a0205388d1df818fe95cf9c3da8ea28b44101331b3faa1f65f251", "zh": "Dark Savant 和 Rapax 真是天生一對，我只能這麼說。 "},
  {"id": 60, "src_sha256": "718eb8bec09294080e67a4ce806875d283614393225fcc2a71845100b0212686", "zh": "我不能說他給人的第一印象很好。而且他的穿衣品味糟透了。 "},
  {"id": 61, "src_sha256": "f8ac53124e99b49405a4948e32d1b5aa0a00e6e5888bb39340d8a29ec6e4019b", "zh": "撇開他那可怕的外表，我覺得他非常有意思。想想看，他竟然知道 Cosmic Circle 和 Forge 的一切！ "},
  {"id": 62, "src_sha256": "e97871b9510ff5b988aaebfd378b6d369a3528e20e106cf98439ee4207cb1dcd", "zh": "這不會解決我們所有的問題，但是個好的開始。話說回來，Dark Savant 到底在哪裡呢？ "},
  {"id": 63, "src_sha256": "f8519ca8bdeee1f81b714d98bb50d7582ca14ddda8973968b27ebf685ff0e1b6", "zh": "所以我們幫忙促成了他們之間的和平？我一向認為自己有外交的天分。 "},
  {"id": 64, "src_sha256": "2c48b442b2cb52fa35c7935912880803130474fa3bb7012bb54d123ce92f6c03", "zh": "這真不令人振奮，對吧？但願殺死他們的東西已經不在附近了。 "},
  {"id": 65, "src_sha256": "ab6d38abb790214e3f4c5795b1fbbc3b5885ef5f2ae73b6416a4057f58217c65", "zh": "真是愉快。接下來呢？ "},
  {"id": 66, "src_sha256": "6c187e04b87e774e4ac23edc054c5edbff18b7ffcbf5954f528be6944b60174e", "zh": "我父親常說，垃圾坑裡可找不到鑽石。要是 Savant 把這個丟了，那它一定是贗品。 "},
  {"id": 67, "src_sha256": "3e7b382e9b74dc12106f6f07d6f27061de10765fe5dbb61bf36b5977adb8471d", "zh": "看那隻生物。 "},
  {"id": 68, "src_sha256": "659d896d776f5cb585e7ada2983315054f6df9b35b85d89032591b8a4825cd10", "zh": "我看到某種野獸。 "},
  {"id": 84, "src_sha256": "34c4143482028b26fb12c8bd637d498afa58f757852810c33e48bbe2082b47a1", "zh": "有進步了。 "},
  {"id": 85, "src_sha256": "21397831a136d7176dd0853943947a07f77a43789f77b4e657e9eef4fd699b81", "zh": "好多了。 "},
  {"id": 121, "src_sha256": "7080a4bc270f1b636b0142ddef7fccd56e913236b1000257d61c20609edf2a40", "zh": "有意思的傢伙，不過有點粗魯。 "},
  {"id": 122, "src_sha256": "41dc4a792e4ceb40bff1f7cfa0344a93c3a284bec68d7f8602ac8855a55d53f3", "zh": "謝謝你提供的消息。我們會看看能幫上什麼忙。 "},
  {"id": 126, "src_sha256": "8932b4769089674e456f5bc6cdef6d1b62f18487ebce88c29d05c200f610af5e", "zh": "我認為 Rapax 得到了他們活該擁有的國王！而且我可不是在稱讚他們。 "},
  {"id": 129, "src_sha256": "0b9ce67ee63c668712f2e2311564cf03bc50e87375f284c750b58bf88196a776", "zh": "這有點麻煩，不是嗎？或許我們應該先探索一下周圍，弄清楚這是哪裡。 "},
  {"id": 130, "src_sha256": "096ec2d9609262e1d0079f26d3787f9e9bef8698034ecd838cb6bca18969ae13", "zh": "你們猜這個奇怪的小玩意兒是做什麼的？ "},
  {"id": 132, "src_sha256": "4095debc8f76b6ac5b498479c257e8464efc61eb31fdb312b8702da592ef114d", "zh": "這就是 Helm of Serenity？恐怕不是我的風格。 "},
  {"id": 141, "src_sha256": "d5be95fd751b706fc53b5ea0c99a321be23ceb1fbccd17533f39e8cf029cbfa1", "zh": "該來泡一下水了。希望大家都準備好潛水了？ "},
  {"id": 142, "src_sha256": "87ee060690d18563789a8373828f097310d4f48a4757557931cbe9a5bb724c7a", "zh": "這就是 Umpani 的要塞？我想挺適合他們的。非常……軍事化。 "}
]
